{"product_id":"canadian-maple-carbon-insert-shaft","title":"Canadian Maple + Carbon Insert Shaft","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTraditional feel. Modern performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCanadian Maple Shaft with Carbon Insert\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a hybrid cue shaft designed for players who want the natural feel and feedback of premium maple with the added stability and low-deflection characteristics of carbon technology.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted from carefully selected \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCanadian maple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, the shaft delivers the warm, familiar feedback and playing feel associated with a traditional wooden shaft. Integrated into the front section is a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecarbon fiber insert\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, reinforcing the shaft where stability matters most while maintaining a lightweight and responsive construction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy the Carbon Insert?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhen applying \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnglish or side spin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, the cue ball can move away from the intended aiming line—a phenomenon commonly known as \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecue-ball squirt or deflection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Shaft construction, particularly the mass and stiffness of the front section, plays an important role in how the shaft responds to off-center hits.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecarbon insert\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e reinforces and stabilizes the front section of the maple shaft, helping reduce front-end movement while maintaining the natural characteristics of the wood. The result is a more predictable shaft response when applying side spin, draw, follow, and other cue-ball control techniques.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKey Advantages\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLow-Deflection Performance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps reduce cue-ball squirt when applying English\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural Maple Feel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Maintains the familiar feedback and response of real Canadian maple\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCarbon Reinforcement\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Adds stiffness and stability to the front section\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImproved Spin Control\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides a more predictable response when using side spin, draw, and follow\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConsistent Power Transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Reinforced construction helps transfer energy efficiently through the shaft\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStable Response\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Carbon reinforcement helps reduce some of the variability associated with an all-wood front section\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTraditional + Modern\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Combines the feel of genuine maple with the performance advantages of carbon technology\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Best of Both Worlds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCanadian Maple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e delivers the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003enatural feel, feedback, and character of real wood.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCarbon Insert\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e adds \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003estability, stiffness, and low-deflection performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTogether, they create a hybrid shaft designed for players who want to \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003efeel the cue while maintaining greater control over the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural wood feel. Carbon-enhanced stability. Low-deflection performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCues Master — Modern Technology. Human Craftsmanship.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43487382831152,"sku":null,"price":3500.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/3e08592b-6892-4091-a1aa-6dfd57f51396.png?v=1786685824","url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/products\